'' 'using strings' MAKES 'Replace' A NAME. std/strings was a facade of exported macros, which
'' 'using' never reaches (RFC-0009 §4), and the bare call was TKO0743; since 2026-10-10 it is
'' a real module, and its public procedures are names like any module's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/using.bas -o tests/modules/stdusing.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdusing.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: zb
